---
---

<section class="section-container not-prose" id="fees">
  <div class="mb-10 text-center md:mx-auto md:mb-12 max-w-3xl">
    <p class="eyebrow">Fees</p>
    <span class="accent-line mx-auto"></span>
    <h2 class="font-heading mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">
      Know what you're paying for
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-[1.65] text-muted">
      We clearly distinguish our service fees from government and third-party charges.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-5xl gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
    <article class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-white p-7 md:p-8 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent">Our service fee</p>
      <h3 class="mt-3 font-heading text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">SK Immigration fee</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-[1.65] text-muted">
        The amount charged by SK Immigration for the agreed service. You'll receive a written scope before payment.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-page p-7 md:p-8 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-secondary">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-primary">External / government fees</p>
      <h3 class="mt-3 font-heading text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">Paid to other providers</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-[1.65] text-muted">
        Separate fees charged by governments, embassies, universities, visa application centres, medical providers,
        couriers, registration authorities and other third parties.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-[1.65] text-muted">
        Those charges are not SK Immigration's service fee, and they are paid to the relevant provider.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
